944
01:13:34,324 --> 01:13:37,293
Cacete!
É uma casa.

945
01:13:39,329 --> 01:13:41,297
Olhe onde pisa.

946
01:14:03,353 --> 01:14:04,320
Josh?

947
01:14:20,303 --> 01:14:23,272
Mike!
Mike!

948
01:14:23,272 --> 01:14:24,273
Vem!

949
01:14:25,308 --> 01:14:29,267
