969
01:16:45,315 --> 01:16:46,282
Josh...

970
01:16:51,321 --> 01:16:53,289
Mike!

971
01:16:55,325 --> 01:16:56,292
Mike!

972
01:16:58,328 --> 01:17:00,296
Mike!

